port security/infisical-cli
type port
reason "DragonFly: give the vendored awnumar/memcall a DragonFly backend (dragonfly/@<line> patches)"

# dragonfly/@<line>/patch-vendor_github.com_awnumar_memcall_*: the vendored
# awnumar/memcall treats DragonFly as Linux and wants MADV_DONTDUMP; give
# it FreeBSD's implementation (MADV_NOCORE, MAP_NOCORE), which DragonFly
# shares.
